  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197852",
      "title": "Managing Redux State & Dispatching Actions",
      "lectureOrder": 121,
      "videoOrder": 117,
      "sourceHash": "1bf2f458e446ac33a9ff58c55da9be31c0d1e1a688cf6eae198c7388f164887d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.74,
          "en": "So let's now use Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.74,
          "end": 6.07,
          "en": "in the different parts of our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.07,
          "end": 8.723,
          "en": "And let's again, start in a Meal Detail screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.62,
          "end": 12.04,
          "en": "There, we again have this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.04,
          "end": 13.58,
          "en": "which we can tap in the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.58,
          "end": 15.68,
          "en": "to toggle our favorites status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.68,
          "end": 17.8,
          "en": "And we need to find out if this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.8,
          "end": 20.45,
          "en": "is a favorite at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.45,
          "end": 22.52,
          "en": "And we're not using Context anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.52,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "so we should remove this, or comment this out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.79,
          "en": "and get rid of these imports, which we don't need anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.79,
          "end": 29.493,
          "en": "Also the useContext Hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.62,
          "end": 32.883,
          "en": "And instead, now we're using Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.98,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "And to get hold of data in our Redux store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.37,
          "en": "we can use a special React Hook provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.37,
          "end": 42.84,
          "en": "by the React-Redux package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 45.363,
          "en": "And that's the useSelector Hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 49.173,
          "en": "You should import this from React-Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 52.84,
          "en": "And then this Hook can be used to get data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.84,
          "end": 54.853,
          "en": "out of our Redux store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.84,
          "end": 56.99,
          "en": "In this case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.99,
          "end": 61.99,
          "en": "I want to get my favorite meal IDs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.47,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "And we can get them by passing a function to useSelector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 71.35,
          "en": "A function which will be executed for us by React-Redux,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.35,
          "end": 73.96000000000001,
          "en": "and a function which should accept a State parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.96000000000001,
          "end": 77.09,
          "en": "because that will be provided by React -Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.09,
          "end": 79.263,
          "en": "when it executes this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.6,
          "end": 83.15,
          "en": "And then we can use this State parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.15,
          "end": 85.2,
          "en": "to drill into our store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.2,
          "end": 88.053,
          "en": "because that in the end refers to our Redux store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.47,
          "end": 92.27000000000001,
          "en": "And to be precise, we can use any keys",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.27000000000001,
          "end": 95.11,
          "en": "that we set up here in this reducer object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.11,
          "end": 97.97,
          "en": "as properties on that State.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.97,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "And then we get hold of the different Slices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 103.47999999999999,
          "en": "and the State managed by these Slices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.47999999999999,
          "end": 106.6,
          "en": "So we can then drill into our State properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.6,
          "end": 108.563,
          "en": "inside of these Slices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.58,
          "end": 112.58,
          "en": "So that means that here we drill into favorite meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.58,
          "end": 116.42,
          "en": "So into state.favoritemeals.ids",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.42,
          "end": 118.7,
          "en": "and that gives us all these favorite IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.7,
          "end": 120.963,
          "en": "managed by that Redux Slice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "Now we can use these favorite meal IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 127.89,
          "en": "to find out if our meal is a favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 131.34,
          "en": "by simply checking if this favorite meal IDs array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.34,
          "end": 132.913,
          "en": "includes this meal ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 137.193,
          "en": "And that is how we can read data from the Redux store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 139.57,
          "en": "Now to change data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.57,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "we have to invoke these reducer methods here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.88,
          "end": 147.95,
          "en": "but we don't do that by calling them manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.95,
          "end": 150.47,
          "en": "instead we dispatch them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.47,
          "end": 153.003,
          "en": "That's why we exported them like this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154,
          "end": 156.89,
          "en": "Now dispatching is also done with help of another Hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.89,
          "end": 159.13,
          "en": "And that's the useDispatch Hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.13,
          "end": 163.04,
          "en": "which is also imported from React-Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.04,
          "end": 166.26,
          "en": "This simply returns a dispatch object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.26,
          "end": 168.65,
          "en": "a dispatch function to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.65,
          "end": 171.19299999999998,
          "en": "which we can execute to dispatch an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.62,
          "end": 174.17000000000002,
          "en": "Now to dispatch an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.17000000000002,
          "end": 176.46,
          "en": "we also need to import that action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.46,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "And for this, we should import from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 182.53,
          "en": "store Redux favorites,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.53,
          "end": 186.65,
          "en": "that is that file where we are exporting these actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.65,
          "end": 189,
          "en": "And from data we can import add favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189,
          "end": 190.553,
          "en": "and remove favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.47,
          "end": 194.6,
          "en": "So simply, these two functions in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.6,
          "end": 195.81,
          "en": "which we are exporting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.81,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "these two actions which are generated by Redux Toolkit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 201.753,
          "en": "for our reducer methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 205.42000000000002,
          "en": "We do have these actions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.42000000000002,
          "end": 209.29,
          "en": "and now when we remove or add Favorites here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.29,
          "end": 212.38,
          "en": "in this change Favorites Status Handler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.38,
          "end": 215.34,
          "en": "we instead call dispatch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.34,
          "end": 217.52,
          "en": "So this dispatch function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.52,
          "end": 220.23,
          "en": "And to this function we pass the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.23,
          "end": 222.513,
          "en": "of calling Remove favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.67000000000002,
          "end": 227.04,
          "en": "So this remove favorite thing we're importing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 230.16,
          "en": "This will create an action object which is then dispatched,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 233.69299999999998,
          "en": "and that's all done under the Hook by the Redux Toolkit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.74,
          "end": 238.01,
          "en": "Now, to this function which we're executing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.01,
          "end": 240.83,
          "en": "remove favorite, we can pass the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.83,
          "end": 243.503,
          "en": "that we would like to have in our action payload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.77,
          "end": 248.57,
          "en": "And in our action payload, I expect to get an ID property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.57,
          "end": 252.42,
          "en": "So I expect my payload to be an object with an ID property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.42,
          "end": 254.733,
          "en": "in both remove and add favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.07,
          "end": 259.69,
          "en": "Therefore, we should pass such an object to remove favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.69,
          "end": 263.253,
          "en": "and set the ID property to meal ID like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.48,
          "end": 267.47,
          "en": "And then we do same down here when we add a favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.47,
          "end": 269.73,
          "en": "but instead of calling remove favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.73,
          "end": 272.27,
          "en": "we call add favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.27,
          "end": 274.36,
          "en": "That is how we can dispatch actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.36,
          "end": 277.553,
          "en": "and how we can read actions with useSelector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279.1,
          "end": 284.1,
          "en": "With all of that, if we reload everything, this should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.86,
          "end": 287.12,
          "en": "And if I go to the detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.12,
          "end": 291.40999999999997,
          "en": "indeed I can toggle this star, so that seems to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.40999999999997,
          "end": 294.23,
          "en": "also on different meals, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.23,
          "end": 295.963,
          "en": "not just on the spaghetti.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 297.37,
          "end": 300.62,
          "en": "But now we, of course, also want to get our favorite meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.62,
          "end": 302.36,
          "en": "on this favorites screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.36,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "And that's there for the next task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 305.15,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.15,
          "end": 308.58,
          "en": "something which you can try implementing on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.58,
          "end": 311.163,
          "en": "before we finish this in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
